[description]

Not every team uses Bitbucket Pipelines; many wire [b]commit statuses[/b] from external systems so PRs stay green/red consistently. Verify status context names so one pipeline does not clobber another.

[b]Webhooks:[/b] validate payloads with shared secrets; handle duplicate deliveries; respond quickly to avoid Bitbucket retry storms.

[b]Takeaway:[/b] glue code is part of the product—monitor webhook failure rates and alert before merges silently lose checks.
